{
    "title": "Bid Master : auction tycoon",
    "description": "Welcome to \"Bid Master,\" a tycoon simulator that seamlessly blends price guessing and auction simulation. In this store games simulator, you'll immerse yourself in intense bidding wars against your rivals, earning vast wealth from high-stakes antique storage auctions. Are you ready to get rich and build your own business empire?\r\n\r\nBecome a legend in the auction world! As a seasoned auctioneer, your goal is to bid on and collect rare items, open a pawn shop, and establish and grow your business. Test your business acumen in this business tycoon simulator and create your own business empire!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce6 Test your auctioning strategy!\r\n-- Collect rare treasures from around the world: antiques, sports cars, motorcycles, ships, famous paintings, second-hand cars, and even alien artifacts! Auction these items and become the richest tycoon in town!\r\n\r\n-- Boss level challenges: Bid on ancient crowns, noble armor, mysterious statues, golden cups, and other valuable treasures. Become the king of warehouse treasure hunting and make a name for yourself in the world of negotiation!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaa Manage your business empire\r\nUse your business savvy to gradually expand your auction kingdom! Grow your business and become a business tycoon! Make more money!\r\n\r\n-- Rent out buildings, open museums, sell cars, run gas stations, fish at fisheries... You can gradually build your own business empire!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Diversified business strategies\r\n-- Simulate deep-sea fishing to catch various rare fish, which you can sell or place in your Fish aquarium! Become a fish tycoon\r\n-- Run your own restaurant! Play some cooking games, cook delicious meals to satisfy your customers, and earn more money!\r\n-- Build your five-star hotel. Collect rent and make a fortune. And create your business empire!\r\n-- Manage a car factory, sell motorcycles, cars, and truck.\r\nSimulate truck operations. Become a factory tycoon and make tons of money!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Guild Wars\r\n-- Join a guild and participate in auction competitions with players from around the globe! Win rich rewards in guild wars!\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t hesitate, start auctioning now! Prepare your bidding strategy and embark on your auction journey! In this ultimate auction management simulator, auction items, manage your business empire, and become a wealthy tycoon!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to &quot;Bid Master,&quot; a tycoon simulator that seamlessly blends price guessing and auction simulation. In this store games simulator, you&#39;ll immerse yourself in intense bidding wars against your rivals, earning vast wealth from high-stakes antique storage auctions. Are you ready to get rich and build your own business empire?<br><br>Become a legend in the auction world! As a seasoned auctioneer, your goal is to bid on and collect rare items, open a pawn shop, and establish and grow your business. Test your business acumen in this business tycoon simulator and create your own business empire!<br><br>\ud83d\udce6 Test your auctioning strategy!<br>-- Collect rare treasures from around the world: antiques, sports cars, motorcycles, ships, famous paintings, second-hand cars, and even alien artifacts! Auction these items and become the richest tycoon in town!<br><br>-- Boss level challenges: Bid on ancient crowns, noble armor, mysterious statues, golden cups, and other valuable treasures. Become the king of warehouse treasure hunting and make a name for yourself in the world of negotiation!<br><br>\ud83d\udcaa Manage your business empire<br>Use your business savvy to gradually expand your auction kingdom! Grow your business and become a business tycoon! Make more money!<br><br>-- Rent out buildings, open museums, sell cars, run gas stations, fish at fisheries... You can gradually build your own business empire!<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d Diversified business strategies<br>-- Simulate deep-sea fishing to catch various rare fish, which you can sell or place in your Fish aquarium! Become a fish tycoon<br>-- Run your own restaurant! Play some cooking games, cook delicious meals to satisfy your customers, and earn more money!<br>-- Build your five-star hotel. Collect rent and make a fortune. And create your business empire!<br>-- Manage a car factory, sell motorcycles, cars, and truck.<br>Simulate truck operations. Become a factory tycoon and 